# Copy to .env.preview — or better, let `yarn wallets:new` write it for you.
#
# ONE file at the repo root serves every example. The suites spell their roles
# differently (ORGANIZER/BIDDER_ONE/BIDDER_TWO in silent-auction, ALICE/BOB/
# CHARLIE elsewhere); those alias onto the four canonical wallets below, so you
# fund four wallets once rather than a set per example.
#
# Fund at the faucet: https://midnight-tmnight-preview.nethermind.dev/
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# _BIRTHDAY: read this before editing by hand
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A wallet's birthday is the chain height at the moment its seed was created.
# It is what lets the wallet fast-sync from the reference bundle in preseed/
# instead of walking the chain from genesis (~75s instead of ~78min).
#
# Pre-seeding is only safe when the birthday is at or after the bundle's
# height. Seeding a wallet that existed earlier starts it past its own funding
# transaction and SILENTLY HIDES ITS FUNDS. So:
#
#   * Only `yarn wallets:new` should ever write a _BIRTHDAY line. It reads the
#     chain tip at the instant it mints the seed, so the value is true.
#   * NEVER add one next to a wallet you already had. Omit it instead: a seed
#     with no birthday just does a normal full sync, which is slow but correct.
#
# See FAST-SYNC.md.

# --- Alice -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Also answers to ORGANIZER, and to the un-roled MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_SEED.
# Needs tNIGHT. The suites register her NIGHT for DUST automatically.
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_ALICE_SEED=replace-with-a-64-char-hex-seed
#MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_ALICE_MNEMONIC=replace-with-24-word-mnemonic
#MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_ALICE_BIRTHDAY=

# --- Bob ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Also answers to BIDDER_ONE. Needs tNIGHT.
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_BOB_SEED=replace-with-a-64-char-hex-seed
#MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_BOB_BIRTHDAY=

# --- Charlie -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Also answers to BIDDER_TWO. Needs tNIGHT.
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_CHARLIE_SEED=replace-with-a-64-char-hex-seed
#MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_CHARLIE_BIRTHDAY=

# --- Dave --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used only by examples/private-party/src/test/sponsorship.test.ts.
# Dave MUST hold tNIGHT and MUST NOT have DUST delegated: the whole point of
# that suite is that Alice pays his fees, and it asserts he has none. The
# funding gate deliberately skips DUST registration for him.
# See examples/private-party/docs/SPONSORSHIP.md.
MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_DAVE_SEED=replace-with-a-64-char-hex-seed
#MIDNIGHT_PREVIEW_DAVE_BIRTHDAY=
